{"name":"Centered Column","description":"Keep one narrow content column centered on the page · A centered column focuses attention on reading or one simple task such as signing in, composing a post, or changing settings. Set a comfortable maximum width and keep supporting actions nearby. It is not suitable for dense dashboards that need side-by-side comparison.","quote":"Keep the content in a narrow column with space on both sides instead of stretching it across the whole screen, like a blog.","agentPrompt":"Change the blog body to a centered narrow column with a readable maximum width tested for Chinese, English, type size, and devices. Keep paragraphs left-aligned, preserve mobile padding, and let code or images widen only when justified.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-centered-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Centered Column</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">Keep the content in a narrow column with space on both sides instead of stretching it across the whole screen, like a blog.</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Keep one narrow content column centered on the page</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>A centered column focuses attention on reading or one simple task such as signing in, composing a post, or changing settings. Set a comfortable maximum width and keep supporting actions nearby. It is not suitable for dense dashboards that need side-by-side comparison.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"centered-wire\">\n    <span class=\"centered-wire-col\">Content column<em>centered and limited to 600~720px</em></span>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">You can say this to an AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>Change the blog body to a centered narrow column with a readable maximum width tested for Chinese, English, type size, and devices. Keep paragraphs left-aligned, preserve mobile padding, and let code or images widen only when justified.</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>When to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Article or essay</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">↔ 60–75 characters per line</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Sign-in and account setup</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:block;width:46%;background:var(--bg);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\">Content column</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Focused form</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-input \">oil-oil</span><span class=\"mk-input \">••••••••</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">Sign in</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Simple settings or editor</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.9;text-align:left\">Body text needs a readable size and line height for long-form reading.</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Place wide tables in a narrow column</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:98%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Center-align long body paragraphs</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:2px;width:46%\"><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Let the column grow too wide on large screens</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"display:block;width:44%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Sign-in card</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Use excessive empty margins when more context is needed</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:70%;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center;line-height:1.7\">This is a long center-aligned paragraph. Every line starts somewhere different, making it tiring after only two lines.</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"page\"><span class=\"centered-wire centered-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"column\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"content\"><span class=\"centered-anat-content\">Login card</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"page\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">Page</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Leave blank space on both sides to help focus attention on the middle</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"column\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">Column</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Centered width limit 600~720px, 60~75 characters per line</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"content\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">Content</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Article, form, or a login card</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Reading</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:60%;min-height:0;padding:4px\"><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:90%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:95%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Long text reading, 60~75 characters per line</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Auth Card</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:8px 0\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:44%;min-height:0;padding:5px;border-style:solid\"><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:70%;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);margin:3px auto 1px\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Log in, register, retrieve password</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Form</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:6px 0;justify-content:flex-start;padding-left:22px\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:56%;min-height:0;padding:4px;align-items:flex-start\"><i style=\"display:block;width:34%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin:1px 0 3px\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:34%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin:1px 0\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Settings page, single column form</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">Typical use cases</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Article</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:6px\">Why did I move my blog to a static site</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n          <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Ali · 3 days ago · Read in 6 minutes</span>\n        </div>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:94%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:97%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Login</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:230px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">\n          <span class=\"tab active\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px\">Login</span>\n          <span class=\"tab\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px\">Register</span>\n        </div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px\" type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;padding:5px;font-size:12px\">Log in</button>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:7px\">Forgot your password? </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Create post</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:9px\">Personal information</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n          <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px\">Change avatar</button>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:3px\">Nickname</div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"Ali\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">Weekly featured emails</span>\n          <label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Profile settings</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:240px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;padding:15px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;margin:0 auto 8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px\">✓</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px\">Subscription successful! </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:10px\">Front-end Weekly is delivered to you@example.com on time at 8 a.m. every Friday</div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px\">Back to homepage</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"selector-recommendation\" aria-label=\"Recommended tool\"><div class=\"section-title\">Recommended tool</div><a class=\"selector-recommendation-card\" href=\"https://selector-pro.org/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open the Selector Pro website to pick a page element and copy a fine-tuning request to AI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"selector-recommendation-copy\"><span class=\"selector-recommendation-label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro</span><h2>Select page elements for precise AI edits</h2><p>Click a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.</p><span class=\"selector-recommendation-action\">Open Selector Pro website<i aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</i></span></div><div class=\"selector-recommendation-demo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"selector-mini-browser-bar\"><i></i><span>your-site.com</span></div><div class=\"selector-mini-page\"><span class=\"selector-mini-logo\"></span><span class=\"selecto