account setup\n\nContent column\n- Focused form\n\noil-oil••••••••\nSign in\n- Simple settings or editor\n\nBody text needs a readable size and line height for long-form reading.\n\n### When NOT to use it\n\n- Place wide tables in a narrow column\n- Center-align long body paragraphs\n- Let the column grow too wide on large screens\n\nSign-in card\n- Use excessive empty margins when more context is needed\n\nThis is a long center-aligned paragraph. Every line starts somewhere different, making it tiring after only two lines.\n\nAnatomy\n\nLogin card\n\n1PageLeave blank space on both sides to help focus attention on the middle\n\n2ColumnCentered width limit 600~720px, 60~75 characters per line\n\n3ContentArticle, form, or a login card\n\nVariants\n\nReading\n\nLong text reading, 60~75 characters per line\n\nAuth Card\n\nLog in, register, retrieve password\n\nForm\n\nSettings page, single column form\n\nTypical use cases\n\nArticle\n\nWhy did I move my blog to a static site\n\n        \nAli · 3 days ago · Read in 6 minutes\n\nLogin\n\nLogin\n          Register\n\n        \n        \n        Log in\n        \nForgot your password?\n\nCreate post\n\nPersonal information\n\n        \nChange avatar\n\n        \nNickname\n\n        \n        \nWeekly featured emails\n\nProfile settings\n\n✓\n\n        \nSubscription successful!\n\n        \nFront-end Weekly is delivered to you@example.com on time at 8 a.m. every Friday\n\n        Back to homepage\n\nRecommended tool\n[Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro\n\n## Select page elements for precise AI edits\n\nClick a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.\nOpen Selector Pro website↗\n\nyour-site.com\n\n**Button · Get started**Use a smaller radius\n\nButton · Get started**Copied for AI**](https://selector-pro.org/)\n\nFurther reading\n\n[Typographyweb.dev ↗](https://web.dev/learn/design/typography/)"}